│ patch_name               │ greedy_pool_localsearch_pipeline                                                          │
│ patch_description        │ Restructure into a modular three-phase pipeline under a shared time budget: (1)           │
│                          │ construction phase builds a pool of candidate schedules using randomized full-lookahead   │
│                          │ greedy with heuristic-plus-random seeds (top single-txn cost seeds plus random starts,    │
│                          │ per recommendations), (2) candidate selection ranks the pool by makespan, (3) refinement  │
│                          │ phase runs first-improvement insertion+swap local search on the top candidates until the  │
│                          │ budget expires. This merges the deterministic lookahead strength of full-lookahead greedy │
│                          │ with restart diversity and local-search polishing, which was the best-performing prior    │
│                          │ configuration, but with cleaner separation of concerns and better time allocation         │
│                          │ (construction gets ~50% of budget, refinement the rest, distributed over top-3            │
│                          │ candidates).                                                                              │
