│ patch_description        │ Combines the best-performing ideas from prior programs (full-lookahead greedy multistart  │
│                          │ with tie-breaking randomness, depth-adaptive beam search, SA with insertion               │
│                          │ intensification) and adds a novel Large Neighborhood Search (LNS) phase: repeatedly       │
│                          │ remove a random contiguous block of k transactions from the best schedule and greedily    │
│                          │ re-insert them at optimal positions, evaluated by true makespan. This "ruin-and-recreate" │
│                          │ paradigm explores a different neighborhood than insertion/swap moves and escapes local    │
│                          │ optima that block pure local search. Also raises the time budget to 28s and dedupes       │
│                          │ candidates for seed diversity.                                                            │
